{"product":{"id":8476540797267,"title":"SYSTEM 4 BIO BOTANICAL SHAMPOO","body_html":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eShampoo for thinning hair\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eShampoo that maintains the natural balance and well-being of the scalp and is suitable for all hair types. Contains soothing and exfoliating active ingredients, a mixture of plant extract that stimulates the superficial circulation of the scalp and refreshing menthol. Contains salicylic acid, which acts as an exfoliating ingredient. Suitable for everyday use. Product is not suitable for children under 3 years of age.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eBENEFITS:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eCreates conditions for healthy hair growth on the scalp\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eStimulates the microcirculation of the scalp\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSuitable for all hair types\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003ePerfume free and dermatologically tested\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe bottle is made of 100% recycled plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUSAGE:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eApply shampoo to damp hair \u0026amp; scalp. Foam and leave on for 2-5 minutes. Rinse well.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003epH 4.8\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Rempire Tower Shop","product_type":"Shampoo","created_at":"2023-07-19T18:32:34+03:00","handle":"system-4-bio-botanical-shampoo","updated_at":"2026-09-02T13:03:23+03:00","published_at":"2023-07-19T18:32:34+03:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"Fall Deals, shampoo, SYSTEM4","variants":[{"id":46863531245907,"product_id":8476540797267,"title":"75ml","price":"9.00","sku":"SYS4-BI